  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bistecca alla Fiorentina is a substantial "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "T-bone",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "t-bone"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " steak cooked fast over fierce heat to build a charred crust, then left "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "resting",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "resting-meat"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " so the juices settle before carving. The steak must be at least 4 cm thick and served rare. Serves 2 to 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use the best beef you can find. Chianina is traditional but any well-hung T-bone with good marbling will work. Season only with black pepper before grilling and dress with olive oil after."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 2,
          "items": [
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "stock-beef",
              "amount": null,
              "unit": "pinch",
              "prepNote": "T-bone steak, at least 4 cm thick and 800 g to 1 kg, at room temperature",
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "extra-virgin-olive-oil",
              "amount": 3,
              "unit": "tbsp",
              "prepNote": "good quality, for dressing after cooking",
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "lemon",
              "amount": 1,
              "unit": null,
              "prepNote": "cut into wedges, to serve",
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "peppercorns-black",
              "amount": null,
              "unit": "pinch",
              "prepNote": "freshly ground",
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "rosemary",
              "amount": 2,
              "unit": "sprigs",
              "prepNote": "optional, for brushing the grill",
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Method"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Take the steak out of the fridge 30 minutes before cooking. Pat it completely dry with kitchen paper. Season generously with black pepper on both sides."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Heat a griddle pan or cast iron skillet over the highest heat for at least 5 minutes. The pan must be very hot before the steak goes on."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Place the steak on the hot griddle. Cook without moving for 5 minutes. A dark crust should form."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Flip once and cook for another 5 minutes. For a 4 cm steak this gives a rare result. Add 2 minutes per side for medium-rare."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Transfer to a board and rest for 10 minutes. Dress with good olive oil and serve with lemon wedges. Carve off the bone and slice against the grain."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "troubleshooter",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "troubleshooterItem",
            "attrs": {
              "issue": "Steak steaming instead of charring"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The pan was not hot enough, or the steak was wet. Pat the meat very dry and heat the pan for longer before starting."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "troubleshooterItem",
            "attrs": {
              "issue": "Centre still cold after resting"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The steak went in cold from the fridge. Always bring it to room temperature first."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "troubleshooterItem",
            "attrs": {
              "issue": "Meat tough when carved"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "It was not rested long enough, or it was sliced with the grain. Rest for the full 10 minutes and always carve across the grain."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Where this dish lives"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bistecca alla Fiorentina belongs to Florence. It is the dish Florentines order to celebrate. The steak is always cooked rare and served without fuss. Olive oil and lemon are the only dressings. No sauce, no garnish beyond a wedge of lemon."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}